{
  "_about": "Spring-bone chains for the Meshy rigged Whale-chan (whalechan_meshy_rigged.glb, 2026-09-02). Selections are boxes RELATIVE TO THE RIG'S OWN BONES in world units of the built model (height 1.0, facing -Y, so 'behind' is +y). On this chibi the head bone sits at the chin (z 0.54) and the head fills the top 0.46 of the height; hips z 0.49. Measured: the tail is the only geometry on her right side more than 0.16 behind the hips and below them; the back hair is the only geometry more than 0.13 behind the head bone below the neck line; the ahoge is the only geometry above 0.92 of height; the fin ears stick out past |x| 0.17 at eye height. Skirt and bangs are left static on purpose (they share space with legs and face).",
